{"schemaVersion":"crv-genre-laya-pilot.v1","caseId":"artist:1940","kind":"artist","entityId":1940,"title":"Fauna Crepuscular","categories":["human_reviewed"],"evidence":[{"ref":"claim:247115","kind":"genre_claim","source":"sincopa","text":"Rock-Ska","url":"https://sincopa.com/rock_pop/artist_rock/fauna_crepuscular.htm"},{"ref":"claim:204536","kind":"biography_claim","source":"rock-de-vzla","text":"Ska Intercolegial rock Al año siguiente participan en el F.N.B y de ahí en adelante se trazaron una carrera musical. Vol II recopilatorio Underground La banda ha participado en importantes festivales como Festival de Música en el Parque, La experiencia roja, etc. Illya Kuriaky and The Valderramas Juanes King Chango Tsé Genitallica Molotov Para el lanzamiento de su tercera placa la banda decide reducir el nombre a Fauna.","url":"https://rockdevzla.blogspot.com/2010/09/fauna-banda-de-ska-de-caracas-que-nace.html"}],"candidates":[{"slug":"rock","name":"Rock","level":"family","family":"rock","evidenceRefs":["claim:247115","claim:204536"]},{"slug":"ska","name":"Ska","level":"genre","family":"reggae-y-ska","evidenceRefs":["claim:247115"]}]}
